              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathcal { X }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is identified with "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathcal { X } ^ { * * }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Thus (5.1) is adequate for a discussion of the weak topology on the unit ball of a separable reflexive space. If "
